WEBVTT

00:05:28.783 --> 00:05:30.076
filling the air.

00:05:30.451 --> 00:05:33.204
The local economy of Raymondville --

00:05:33.245 --> 00:05:36.040
that's the county seat
of Willacy County --

00:05:36.082 --> 00:05:37.708
it runs on produce --

00:05:37.708 --> 00:05:41.212
on produce and on prisons.

00:05:41.253 --> 00:05:43.089
Tucked behind a state jail,

00:05:43.089 --> 00:05:48.594
the Willacy County Detention Center
houses federal immigration prisoners

00:05:48.636 --> 00:05:50.513
in large canvas tents.

00:05:51.430 --> 00:05:54.016
A few years ago, this facility shut down,

00:05:54.058 --> 00:05:55.726
after inmates rebelled.

00:05:56.519 --> 00:05:59.230
And when that happened,
I was not surprised,

00:05:59.230 --> 00:06:02.358
because back when I used
to represent clients there,